{"3689950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mega Mash Mons", "steam_appid": 3689950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>First update incoming!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mega Mash Mons now has a fully integrated experience system which grants you ability points to level up stats the way you prefer!<br><br>The first Monstrosity has been captured and is now available to play, Enter Panthriar with its unique pounce ability!<br><br>A whole new mode is ready to be experienced with 1v1 brawling on a new docks themed battle field!<br><br>Targeting systems implemented! select and switch between targets for auto aiming and special abilities!<br><br>Coming soon - next up is multiplayer capability, entire menu renovation to accommodate the upgrades and new modes, Mons customization, and of course, more Monstrosities!         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/953b2de897f5d5125824178d3f58e59a.avif?t=1787346859\" width=416 height=416 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!Game Up!</p></p><br><h1>Closed Beta is now live!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/356acd1e7d10404b4017db305eb854b9.poster.avif?t=1787346859\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/356acd1e7d10404b4017db305eb854b9.webm?t=1787346859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/356acd1e7d10404b4017db305eb854b9.mp4?t=1787346859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/1ec0056724fac5afa57cdc5608e426a8.poster.avif?t=1787346859\" width=678 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/1ec0056724fac5afa57cdc5608e426a8.webm?t=1787346859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/1ec0056724fac5afa57cdc5608e426a8.mp4?t=1787346859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mega Mash Mons is a third person giant monster brawler featuring ground, air, and water battles oriented on quick giant monstrosity vs giant monstrosity matches. By the official release Players will be able to fight through campaigns and different game modes with a large roster of playable characters to choose from, battling other player and ai controlled avatars as well as military units and building sized boss monsters, in an effort to grow your character stronger than any other while unlocking a vast and immersive scientifically accurate fiction story. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title has been in independent production for only 2 years with analytics being started immediately after the founder of Dotosy® earned his Bachelors of Science degree in Game Design from Full Sail University. Everything from initial popularity statistics, through all programming to Beta art and polish, has been created solely by the companies founder. No outside assets have been used in the production of this game.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/1ec0056724fac5afa57cdc5608e426a8.poster.avif?t=1787346859\" width=678 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689950/extras/1ec0056724fac5afa57cdc5608e426a8.webm?t=1787346859\" type=\